The '''Oetchi system''' was a remote [[star system]]<ref name="TLJ Junior Novel">''[[Star Wars: The Last Jedi: A Junior Novel]]''</ref> located in the [[Bon'nyuw-Luq sector]] of the [[Outer Rim Territories]]<ref name="Appendix" /> that the [[Resistance]] rendezvoused in after [[Battle of D'Qar|evacuating]] their [[Resistance base|base]] on [[D'Qar]]. Shortly after arriving in the system, they were [[Battle of Oetchi|attacked]] by the [[First Order]].<ref name="TLJ Junior Novel" />

